        "id": "NamiW",
        "name": "Ebb and Flow",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Unleashes a stream of water that bounces back and forth between allied and enemy champions, healing allies and damaging enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Nami unleashes a stream of water that bounces between allied and enemy champions. Each champion can only be hit once, and it hits up to 3 targets.<span>Restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(55/80/105/130/155 + (40% Ability Power)) Health</span> to allies and will bounce to a nearby enemy champion. <span>Deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/95/130/165/200 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to enemies and will bounce to a nearby allied champion.<br />The damage and healing value is modified by (-20% + (0.15% Ability Power)) each bounce.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Can only bounce to visible enemies.</span>",
