        "bodyHtml": "Nami summons a tidal wave, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Up</span> for 0.5 seconds, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 70%, and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. The duration of the <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> increases based on distance the wave traveled, up to 4 seconds.<br /><br />Allies hit by the wave gain double the effect of <span>Surging Tides</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> has a minimum duration of 2 seconds.</span>",
